《典当》SUNSHINE PAWN — credits for third-party material

Picture and sound are made entirely in code; no stock footage, samples, voices or generated images.

Style
- Visual style: "80s Cel Anime" from the Lemo-Opuscar style library (https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar).
  The drawing helpers cel.js, fx.js, post.js and parts of bg.js, and the synth instrument kernels in music/score.py,
  are adapted from that style's demo engine, under the MIT License (LICENSE-MIT-lemo-opuscar.txt).

