Music and sound
- Original score, synthesised with numpy/numba (music/score.py). No samples.
- All foley and ambience synthesised procedurally (mix.py, with the library's core/audio/sfx.py).

Signs and names
- All shop signs, the pawnshop and the advertisement are fictional and generic. No real brands appear.
